  "_comment": "Identity corrections, owner-editable. 'players' maps source spellings to canonical handles (the CWL archive title-cases stylized gamertags); 'teams' merges names the CWL archive uses inconsistently for the same team. Casing variants are preserved in player_aliases; a spelling mapped here is applied at parse time and so never reaches that table. 'orgs' groups distinct branded identities under one organisation so a rebrand keeps one rating curve; membership is only asserted where the two brands' series windows do not overlap — a concurrent second roster is an academy team, not a rebrand. 'cito_teams' undoes Cito's retroactive branding: Cito stamps each franchise slot's CURRENT name on every historical match, so each slug maps to its dated brand history, keyed by CDL season year (a season starts in Nov/Dec of the prior calendar year). 'status: review' entries are provisional until the owner confirms them.",
